// Copy to QA.local.xcconfig (git-ignored) to fill in the QA build's sandbox
// values locally. See docs/qa-build.md. Placeholders only: as written, the QA
// build treats these as invalid and keeps checkout unavailable.
// "//" starts an xcconfig comment, so write URLs with $(SLASH)$(SLASH).

